 This is probably the **most important part for a technical interview**.

 Don't just say, "AWS team found the issue."

 Say:

 > “I followed the dependency chain from the application layer down.”

 Then explain:

```
XL-Release
    ↓
Pods not starting
    ↓
Pods in Pending state
    ↓
PVC unbound
    ↓
PV provisioning failing
    ↓
