 # 4\. Explain the 5 Whys naturally

 If the interviewer asks, **“What was your RCA?”**, don't mechanically read all five questions.

 Tell it as a chain:

 > **Why didn't XL-Release come up?**\
>  Because the pods were stuck in Pending state.
>
>  **Why were the pods Pending?**\
>  Because their PersistentVolumeClaims were not getting bound.
>
>  **Why couldn't the PV be provisioned?**\
>  Because the storage provisioning process couldn't communicate properly with EFS.
>
>  **Why was communication with EFS broken?**\
>  The required VPC endpoint had been deleted.
>
>  **Why was the VPC endpoint deleted?**\
>  It was removed during an account cleanup activity because it was considered unused.

 Then conclude:

 > “So the immediate technical root cause was the missing VPC endpoint, while the process root cause was insufficient validation before deleting resources during cleanup.”

 That last sentence is especially important.

